<title>TURKMENISTAN: Turkmen Jan-Nov 96 cotton output down 4.3 percent.</title>
<headline>Turkmen Jan-Nov 96 cotton output down 4.3 percent.</headline>
<dateline>ASHGABAD 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turkmenistan produced 270,500 tonnes of cotton fibre over January-November 1996, a 4.3 percent drop on year-earlier levels, the State Statistics Committee said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>It provided the following data:</p>
<p>				    Nov 96    Oct 96    Jan-Nov 96</p>
<p> Cotton-fibre (tonnes)	33,000    37,200     270,500</p>
<p> mth/mth pct change	   -11.3	 n/a</p>
<p> yr/yr  pct change					  -4.3</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, + 7 3272 509410</p>
</text>
